changelog_entry: >-
  Revision 12 (graph, text only): three wording fixes from the 2026-09-15 review
  of revision 11. The narrow-repair check now reads the kickoff criteria at value
  level instead of naming a digest that no record stores; run_paused no longer
  says a paused run records "terminal classification incomplete", a value the
  run-state final_status field cannot hold - the pause node preserves resumable
  state and the lead skill carries the walk-away duty; host_ready says capacity
  is decided, not settled, per job lease. No node, outcome, edge, check, role,
  evidence path, or state field changes.
